  "body": "• Renovated throughout with a fresh coastal feel\r\n• Bespoke kitchen, stunning modern bathroom, and quality finishes throughout\r\n• Coastal shutters, fully fenced section, and easy-care living\r\n• Off-street parking for multiple vehicles, plus room for the boat or campervan\r\n• Flat walk to Orewa Beach, cafés, shops, and amenities\r\n\r\nBeautifully renovated from top to bottom, this immaculate brick and tile home offers stylish, low-maintenance living in a highly sought-after cul-de-sac location.\r\n\r\nThe sunny and light-filled open-plan living, dining, and bespoke kitchen flow effortlessly to the outdoor entertaining areas and a private, fully fenced garden. Coastal shutters add charm and character, while the stunning modern bathroom and quality finishes ensure all the hard work has already been done.\r\n\r\nWith three generous bedrooms, including a spacious master suite with sliding doors opening directly to the sunny garden, a large Jack and Jill family bathroom, and a separate toilet, this home offers practical single-level living at its best. Ample parking provides plenty of room for the boat, campervan, or additional vehicles, making it perfectly suited to families, downsizers, or those seeking an easy lock-and-leave lifestyle.\r\n\r\nOutside, the covered rear patio provides the perfect space to relax and entertain, with a dedicated area ready for a spa pool and power already in place for added convenience.\r\n\r\nPositioned just a short stroll from Orewa Beach, the town centre, cafés, restaurants, and the Te Ara Tahuna walkway, this is a rare opportunity to secure a beautifully updated home in a location that continues to be in high demand.",
